WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In Pakistan, choosing a profile is not enough. The scope and outcome should be clear.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Write your need in English, Urdu or Roman Urdu.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.300
This sample follows a home bakery looking for a logo.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:27.400
Define deliverables, then understand why a provider may fit.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:35.500
Review submitted files against the agreed scope.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:41.500
AI can offer signals; a person makes the decision.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.840
The receipt is only a sample. Try the interactive demo—no real task or payment.

